y)\n909: \n910: - [ ] Implement global error boundary\n911:   - Catch React component errors\n912:   - Display user-friendly error message\n913:   - Log error details\n914: - [ ] Add input validation\n915:   - Validate all user inputs\n916:   - Validate configuration parameters\n917:   - Prevent NaN and infinity\n918: - [ ] Handle edge cases gracefully\n919:   - Empty grid states\n920:   - Zero flux scenarios\n921:   - Invalid level numbers\n922:   - Corrupted localStorage\n923: - [ ] Add retry mechanisms\n924:   - Retry failed operations with exponential backoff\n925:   - Graceful degradation when features fail\n926: - [ ] Handle browser compatibility\n927:   - Check for required APIs (Web Audio, Canvas)\n928:   - Fallbacks for unsupported features\n929:   - Clear error messages\n930: \n931: **Dependencies**: All systems\n932: \n933: ### 6.2 Accessibility (LOW - Inclusivity)\n934: \n935: - [ ] Implement keyboard navigation\n936:   - Arrow keys for grid navigation\n937:   - Enter/Space to place cells\n938:   - Escape to cancel/close panels\n939:   - Tab navigation through UI controls\n940: - [ ] Add screen reader support\n941:   - ARIA labels for UI elements\n942:   - Announce game state changes\n943:   - Alternative text for visual elements\n944:   - Live regions for score/timer updates\n945: - [ ] Implement reduced motion support\n946:   - Respect prefers-reduced-motion media query\n947:   - Disable animations when requested\n948:   - Simplified visual feedback\n949: - [ ] Add high contrast mode\n950:   - Toggle for high contrast colors\n951:   - Larger text option\n952:   - Improved readability\n953: - [ ] Ensure minimum touch targets\n954:   - 44×44px minimum for mobile\n955:   - Spacious clickable areas\n956: - [ ] Focus management\n957:   - Visible focus indicators\n958:   - Logical tab order\n959:   - Focus trap in modals\n960: \n961: **Dependencies**: UI components, user interaction\n962: \n963: ### 6.3 Performance Optimization (LOW - Performance)\n964: \n96