nification - PARTIALLY COMPLETE\n- ✅ Sound engine implementation\n- ✅ Generation sounds\n- ✅ Interaction sounds\n- ✅ Configuration\n- ❌ Simulation start sound (NOT CONNECTED)\n- ❌ Level complete sound (NOT CONNECTED)\n- ❌ Level start sound (NOT CONNECTED)\n- ❌ Transition whoosh sound (NOT CONNECTED)\n- ❌ Insufficient flux sound (NOT CONNECTED)\n\n#### Visual Polish - PARTIALLY COMPLETE\n- ✅ Score animation polish (smooth increment, pulse, milestone flash)\n- ✅ Flux counter color coding\n- ✅ Intro glitch effect\n- ✅ Glass effect polish\n- ❌ Cell animations (fade-in, shrink) - NOT IMPLEMENTED\n- ❌ Cell preview ghost outline - PARTIALLY (basic ghost, not different colors for draw/erase)\n\n#### Mobile Enhancements - PARTIALLY COMPLETE\n- ✅ touch-action: none on canvas\n- ✅ Minimum touch targets (44×44px)\n- ❌ Touch ripple effect (optional)\n- ❌ Mobile expert settings access (triple-tap gesture)\n\n### Sprint 5: Expert Settings & Advanced Features\n\n#### Expert Settings Panel - ✅ COMPLETE (in SettingsPanel.tsx)\n- ✅ All parameter categories implemented\n- ✅ Settings persistence\n- ✅ Reset to defaults\n- ❌ Presets system (Easy, Normal, Hard, Chaos) - NOT IMPLEMENTED\n- ❌ Danger zone for extreme settings - NOT IMPLEMENTED\n- ❌ Tooltips/documentation - NOT IMPLEMENTED\n\n### Sprint 6: Quality Assurance\n\n#### Error Handling & Resilience - NOT IMPLEMENTED\n- ❌ Global error boundary\n- ❌ Input validation beyond type checks\n- ❌ Edge case graceful degradation\n- ❌ Retry mechanisms\n- ❌ Browser compatibility checks\n\n#### Accessibility - NOT IMPLEMENTED\n- ❌ Keyboard navigation (arrow keys, Enter/Space, Escape, Tab)\n- ❌ Screen reader support (ARIA labels, live regions)\n- ❌ Reduced motion support\n- ❌ High contrast mode\n- ❌ Focus management\n\n#### Performance Optimization - NOT IMPLEMENTED\n- ❌ Performance monitoring (FPS counter)\n- ❌ Memoization for expensive calculations\n- ❌ Virtualization (if applicable)\n- ❌ Lazy loading (non-critical components)\n- ❌ Code splitting\n\n#### Testing - ✅ COMPLETE\n- ✅ Testing framework setup (Vitest)\n- ✅ Unit tests for all core systems\n- ✅ Component tests\n- ✅ 273 tests passing\n- ❌ Integration tests (end-to-end game flow)\n- ❌ Manual testing procedures\n\n#### Documentation - NOT IMPLEMENTED\n- ❌ README.md with project overview\n- ❌ Code comments for complex algorithms\n- ❌ API interface documentation\n- ❌ Developer guide\n- ❌ Expert settings documentation\n\n---\n\n## Integration Status\n\n### ✅ Working Integrations\n1. **Simulation → Movement → Scoring**: Fully integrated in Game.tsx\n2. **Phase → Timer → Simulation**: Fully integrated via usePhaseTimer\n3. **Flux → GridInteraction**: Fully integrated\n4. **Settings → All Systems**: Expert settings properly injected and persisted\n5. **Canvas → Rendering**: Age-based colors, glow effects working\n6. **ScoreDisplay → Scoring**: Real-time score updates with animations\n\n### ⚠️ Partial Integrations\n1. **Audio Engine**: Implemented but sounds not connected to events\n   - playGenerationSound exists but not called in simulation step\n   - playInteractionSound exists but not called in GridInteraction\n2. **IntroOverlay**: Implemented but not shown in App.tsx\n3. **UIToggleButton**: Implemented but not integrated in Game component\n\n### ❌ Missing Integrations\n1. **Level Progression**: Not implemented at all\n2. **Transition System**: Not implemented at all\n3. **Victory Screen**: Not implemented at all\n4. **Keyboard Navigation**: Not implemented\n5. **Accessibility Features**: Not implemented\n\n---\n\n## Obvious Bugs or Issues\n\n### Minor Issues:\n1. **IntroOverlay background simulation**: Component shows \"background game rendering (attract mode)\" but there's no actual simulation running in the background\n2. **UIToggleButton**: Component exists but is never rendered (not in App.tsx or Game.tsx)\n3. **Flux color coding**: In GlassHUD.tsx, `getFluxColor` has a duplicate condition (ratio < 0.5 returns same as ratio >= 0.3)\n4. **Cell ghost