, victory screen, accessibility, and performance optimizations. The codebase is well-structured with excellent test coverage for implemented features.\n</task_result>","title":"Explore source code","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39d54a39affeYO6EDcWm0FsxHS","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771181923592,"end":1771182019335}}}}
