{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1771182097731,"sessionID":"ses_39d54d119ffe5wknN3nwR32dw0","part":{"id":"prt_c62ad0192001LYgrrxzfGQlcjo","sessionID":"ses_39d54d119ffe5wknN3nwR32dw0","messageID":"msg_c62acd3e7001lExbxnrYYGbyMD","type":"tool","callID":"call_be4a82a226384ee49e2b023e","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Search for level/transition code","prompt":"Search the codebase for any implementation of:\n1. Level progression (level.ts, currentLevel, levelNumber)\n2. Transition system (transitions.ts, FADING_OUT, INTERSTITIAL, FADING_IN)\n3. Victory screen (VictoryScreen.tsx, victory)\n4. Audio sound connections (where are playGenerationSound, playInteractionSound called?)\n\nLook for:\n- src/lib/level.ts existence\n- src/lib/transitions.ts existence\n- src/components/VictoryScreen.tsx existence\n- Calls to sound engine methods in Game.tsx, CanvasGrid.tsx, GridInteraction.tsx\n- Any phase transition handling that would trigger level changes\n\nReport on what exists vs what's missing.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"task_id: ses_39d52fe67ffe5WRJzh6pYx0YwG (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\n## Search Results Report\n\nBased on my thorough search of the codebase, here is what exists versus what's missing for the requested features:\n\n---\n\n### 1. Level Progression (level.ts, currentLevel, levelNumber)\n\n**MISSING:**\n- `src/lib/level.ts` - Does NOT exist\n- No `currentLevel` state variable in Game.tsx\n- No level management logic (level advancement, level completion detection)\n- No \"Level X\" display UI in the game\n- No victory screen display after final level\n\n**EXISTS (type definitions only):**\n- `LevelConfig` interface in `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/types/index.ts` (lines 43-47):\n  ```typescript\n  interface LevelConfig {\n    levelNumber: number\n    timeLimitSeconds: number\n    initialFlux: number\n  }\n  ```\n\n- `LevelProgression` interface in `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/types/index.ts` (lines 61-66):\n  ```typescript\n  interface LevelProgression {\n    currentLevel: number\n    maxUnlockedLevel: number\n    totalScore: number\n    levels: LevelConfig[]\n  }\n  ```\n\n- `LevelGenerationParams` interface with createInitialLevelGenerationParams() in `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/settings.ts`\n\n**DOCUMENTATION ONLY:**\n- Spec exists: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/specs/level-progression.md`\n- Marked as \"[ ] Implement level configuration (src/lib/level.ts)\" in IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md\n\n---\n\n### 2. Transition System (transitions.ts, FADING_OUT, INTERSTITIAL, FADING_IN)\n\n**MISSING:**\n- `src/lib/transitions.ts` - Does NOT exist\n- No transition management logic in Game.tsx\n- No fade overlay component\n- No interstitial screen component\n- No transition state machine (PLAYING → FADING_OUT → INTERSTITIAL → FADING_IN → READY)\n- No keyboard skip handling (Space/ESC) for transitions\n\n**EXISTS (type definitions only):**\n- `TransitionState` type in `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/types/index.ts` (line 7):\n  ```typescript\n  export type TransitionState = 'PLAYING' | 'FADING_OUT' | 'INTERSTITIAL' | 'FADING_IN' | 'READY'\n  ```\n\n- `TransitionConfig` interface in `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/types/index.ts` (lines 77-83):\n  ```typescript\n  interface TransitionConfig {\n    fadeOutDuration: number\n    fadeInDuration: number\n    interstitialDuration: number\n    autoAdvanceDelay: number\n    skipEnabled: boolean\n  }\n  ```\n\n**EXISTS (different system):**\n- Phase transitions exist: `GamePhase` type with values 'PLANNING' | 'COUNTDOWN' | 'RUNNING' | 'FINISHED'\n- Phase management in `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/phase.ts` handles single-game session flow\n- `usePhaseTimer` hook in `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/hooks/usePhaseTimer.ts`\n\n**DOCUMENTATION ONLY:**\n- Spec exists: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/specs/auto-advance-transitions.md`\n- Marked as \"[ ] Implement transition system (src/lib/transitions.ts)\" in IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md\n\n---\n\n### 3. Victory Screen (VictoryScreen.tsx, victory)\n\n**MISSING:**\n- `src/components/VictoryScreen.tsx` - Does NOT exist\n- No victory-related component\n- No victory state management in Game.tsx\n- No \"Play Again\" or \"Return to Menu\" options after final level\n\n**DOCUMENTATION ONLY:**\n- Mentioned in IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md (lines 631, 678, 1115, 1124) as \"[ ] Implement victory screen\"\n- Mentioned in `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/specs/level-progression.md` (line 70-72)\n\n---\n\n### 4. Audio Sound Connections (playGenerationSound, playInteractionSound)\n\n**EXISTS (sound engine implementation):**\n- `src/lib/audio.ts` contains `SoundEngine` class with both methods (lines 42, 72):\n  - `playGenerationSound(bornCount: number, avgRow: number, totalRows: number): void`\n  - `playInteractionSound(type: 'draw' | 'erase'): void`\n\n- Tests exist: `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/lib/audio.test.ts` calls both methods\n\n**MISSING (no integration with game):**\n- No `SoundEngine` import in Game.tsx\n- No `SoundEngine` instantiation in Game.tsx\n- **No calls to `playGenerationSound()` in Game.tsx** - the `handleSimulationStep` function (lines 56-82) does not call any audio methods\n- **No calls to `playInteractionSound()` in GridInteraction.tsx** - the `handleCellClick` function (lines 31-72) does not call any audio methods\n- No audio integration in CanvasGrid.tsx\n\n**EXISTS (settings only):**\n- Audio settings UI in `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/components/SettingsPanel.tsx` (lines 56-113)\n- `AudioParams` interface in types/index.ts\n- Settings for audio enabled, volume, and waveform in ExpertSettings\n\n---\n\n### Summary Table\n\n| Feature | File/Component | Status |\n|---------|---------------|--------|\n| **Level Progression** | `src/lib/level.ts` | MISSING |\n| | `currentLevel` state | MISSING |\n| | \"Level X\" display | MISSING |\n| | Level advancement logic | MISSING |\n| **Transition System** | `src/lib/transitions.ts` | MISSING |\n| | Fade overlay component | MISSING |\n| | Interstitial screen | MISSING |\n| | FADING_OUT/INTERSTITIAL/FADING_IN state machine | MISSING |\n| | Keyboard skip (Space/ESC) | MISSING |\n| **Victory Screen** | `src/components/VictoryScreen.tsx` | MISSING |\n| | Victory state management | MISSING |\n| **Audio Integration** | `playGenerationSound()` calls | MISSING |\n| | `playInteractionSound()` calls | MISSING |\n| | SoundEngine integration in Game.tsx | MISSING |\n| | SoundEngine integration in GridInteraction.tsx | MISSING |\n\n### Key Findings\n\n1. **Type definitions exist but implementation is missing** - All the TypeScript interfaces are defined (LevelConfig, TransitionState, etc.) but the actual logic to use them is not implemented.\n\n2. **Audio engine is built but disconnected** - The SoundEngine class is fully implemented and tested, but it's never imported or used in the game components.\n\n3. **Phase system exists but is single-session only** - The current phase system (PLANNING → COUNTDOWN → RUNNING → FINISHED → PLANNING) works for a single session but doesn't handle multi-level progression.\n\n4. **No level advancement triggers** - When FINISHED phase completes, it just resets to PLANNING for the same level (line 152-159 in phase.ts). There's no logic to advance to the next level or detect if it's the final level.\n\n5. **Specs are written but not implemented** - Both level-progression.md and auto-advance-transitions.md have detailed specifications but the actual code doesn't reflect these designs.\n</task_result>","title":"Search for level/transition code","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39d52fe67ffe5WRJzh6pYx0YwG","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771182031254,"end":1771182097729}}}}
