ERASING\n- **BUT**: `GridInteraction.tsx` does NOT import or instantiate `SoundEngine`\n- **BUT**: No `playInteractionSound('draw')` or `playInteractionSound('erase')` calls exist\n- Interaction occurs silently\n\n---\n\n### 3. **Sounds for Phase Transitions (COUNTDOWN → RUNNING)**\n**Status: NOT CONNECTED ❌**\n\nPhase transitions occur in `/home/ochanomizu/repos/game_of_life/src/hooks/usePhaseTimer.ts`:\n\n- **COUNTDOWN → RUNNING**: Line 110-113 (when `canTransition` becomes true after countdown)\n  ```typescript\n  useEffect(() => {\n    if (phaseState.current === 'COUNTDOWN' && phaseState.canTransition) {\n      startRunning(45)\n    }\n  }, [phaseState.canTransition, phaseState, startRunning])\n  ```\n  \n- **RUNNING → FINISHED**: Line 116-119 (when timer reaches 0)\n  \n- **FINISHED → PLANNING**: Line 122-125 (after 2-second delay)\n\n**BUT**: None of these transitions play any audio\n\n---\n\n### 4. **Sounds for Level Complete, Level Start, Transitions**\n**Status: NOT CONNECTED ❌**\n\nThe codebase has the following events that could trigger sounds, but NONE do:\n\n- **Level/Phase Complete**: `finishPhase` called (usePhaseTimer.ts line 76, 117)\n- **Reset/Level Start**: `resetPhase` called (usePhaseTimer.ts line 80, 123)\n- **Game Start**: `handleStart` in Game.tsx (line 100)\n- **Game Clear**: `handleClear` in Game.tsx (line 115)\n- **Game Randomize**: `handleRandom` in Game.tsx (line 124)\n- **Score Milestones**: `isMilestoneReached` function exists in scoring.ts (line 88) but is never called\n\nNo audio is played for any of these events.\n\n---\n\n## Summary\n\n| Sound Event | Status | Location | Issue |\n|------------|--------|----------|-------|\n| `playGenerationSound` | ❌ NOT CALLED | Game.tsx | SoundEngine never instantiated |\n| `playInteractionSound` (draw) | ❌ NOT CALLED | GridInteraction.tsx | SoundEngine never instantiated |\n| `playInteractionSound` (erase) | ❌ NOT CALLED | GridInteraction.tsx | SoundEngine never instantiated |\n| COUNTDOWN → RUNNING transition | ❌ NO SOUND | usePhaseTimer.ts | No audio integration |\n| RUNNING → FINISHED transition | ❌ NO SOUND | usePhaseTimer.ts | No audio integration |\n| Level/Phase complete | ❌ NO SOUND | usePhaseTimer.ts | No audio integration |\n| Phase reset | ❌ NO SOUND | usePhaseTimer.ts | No audio integration |\n| Game start | ❌ NO SOUND | Game.tsx | No audio integration |\n\n---\n\n## Audio Infrastructure Status\n\n✅ **EXISTS BUT UNUSED:**\n- `SoundEngine` class with `playGenerationSound()` and `playInteractionSound()` methods\n- Audio configuration in `ExpertSettings` (`audio.enabled`, `audio.volume`, `audio.waveform`)\n- Audio settings UI in SettingsPanel.tsx\n- Tests for audio functionality (audio.test.ts)\n- Simulation provides `bornCount` and `averageRow` data needed for generation sounds\n\n❌ **MISSING:**\n- Any instantiation of `SoundEngine` in the application\n- Import statements for audio in any component\n- Calls to audio methods at any game events\n- Phase transition sound hooks\n- Level complete/start sound hooks\n\n**The entire audio system is implemented but completely disconnected from the game.**\n</task_result>","title":"Check audio integration","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_39d52fe5cffebT6RvZoMMngy0T","model":{"modelID":"glm-4.7","providerID":"zai-coding-plan"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1771182031265,"end":1771182129038}}}}
